---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@/components/Breadcrumb.astro";
import Main from "@/components/Main.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import config from "@/config";

const pageTitle = "About";
const pageDescription = "Challenging the Stochastic Wall in AI, Quantum Biology & Philosophy";
---

<Layout
  title={`${pageTitle} | ${config.site.title}`}
  description={pageDescription}
>
  <Header />

  <Breadcrumb />

  <Main pageTitle={pageTitle} class="app-prose">
    <h2>NIECHAOS</h2>

    <h3>Challenging the Stochastic Wall in AI, Quantum Biology &amp; Philosophy</h3>

    <p>
      Modern physics, neurobiology, and the philosophy of science have hit a stochastic wall. For nearly a century, under the Copenhagen imperative—<em>“Shut up and calculate!”</em>—inquiring into the physical source code of reality was forbidden. Probability, background fluctuations, and blind chance were elevated to foundational principles, concealing a lack of understanding of the underlying carrier mechanics.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Niechaos</strong> bridges hard, peer-reviewed data from biophysics, cybernetics, quantum biology, and natural philosophy with the deterministic Substrate Model—an architectural approach grounded in phase geometry and causal necessity rather than dice rolls.
    </p>

    <h4>Methodology (105% Total):</h4>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>90% Empirical Facts:</strong> Peer-reviewed research from <em>Nature</em>, <em>Science</em>, <em>Cell</em>, <em>Neuron</em>, microtubule physics, mycorrhizal electrophysiology, noise floor collapse measurements, and closed-loop control tests. Zero speculation at the raw data level.</li>
      <li><strong>10% Substrate Architecture:</strong> Exposing the underlying carrier mechanics, phase-lock geometry (N=55), and metric resistance (&eta;) where mainstream models settle for probability.</li>
      <li><strong>5% Philosophy &amp; Authorial Commentary:</strong> Stripping away the academic armor. Direct, unfiltered perspectives on ontology, time, consciousness, and the edges of existence.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      <em>(Yes, that adds up to 105%. Consider the extra 5% a deliberate margin for phenomena that normalized probability distributions fail to contain).</em>
    </p>

    <p>
      Neither romantic mysticism nor reductionist materialism—just hard phase geometry engineering and sound ontology. Beyond stochastics, there is no chaos. There is only a deterministic mechanism waiting to be explored.
    </p>
  </Main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
